  {
   "heading": "Ups and downs notation",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "55edo can be notated with ups and downs , spoken as up, dup, downsharp, sharp, upsharp etc. and down, dud, upflat etc. Note that dup is equivalent to dudsharp and dud is equivalent to dupflat.\nAlternative symbols for ups and downs notation uses sharps and flats with arrows, borrowed from extended Helmholtz–Ellis notation :"
  },
